      "text": "This choice reflects the rapid rise of artificial intelligence.",
      "start_sec": 54.062,
      "end_sec": 59.177,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/7a0ebcabfcc9ca185a9af3aadcefeacece8c8cb9de26f6c2c733437bdb41f305.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s02"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "這項選擇反映了人工智慧的迅速崛起。",
      "start_sec": 59.977,
      "end_sec": 64.578,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/0ae84057d28683bd23553eb536d5505d82b495940b16258484c67404cdb365a3.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s02"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "AI is now a major topic in daily conversations and news.",
      "start_sec": 65.178,
      "end_sec": 71.143,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/0fd8b2ea4532562fa6d7d78dff9f2700f5442b7e983730ba9e6a5f105d5ea621.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "人工智慧如今已成為日常對話和新聞中的主要話題。",
      "start_sec": 71.943,
      "end_sec": 77.424,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/bb568454047d8136d543a53b9ce87662a99f589f1f4acb450cf10b8493d11114.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s03"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Experts discuss AI's impact on work, creativity, and society.",
      "start_sec": 78.024,
      "end_sec": 83.798,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/95c9f89bd95104d9d052dd3496b257852616923fd3cebecdd463ed1680718902.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s04"
    },
    {
      "type": "zh",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "專家們討論人工智慧對工作、創造力和社會的影響。",
      "start_sec": 84.598,
      "end_sec": 90.478,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/1bec67d3a944e207d934d59d0e47057526a83732a179c26e7bfa271f4899b03b.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s04"
    },
    {
      "type": "en",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "The word highlights the ongoing debate about machines and people.",
      "start_sec": 91.078,
      "end_sec": 96.705,
      "audio_file": "/home/runner/work/daily-news-english/daily-news-english/.tts_cache/0fb8c85127cc11c24b472551ad7aac96943a22934d70c6a026aa2db01c696910.wav",
      "story_index": 1,
      "sentence_id": "s05"
    },
